{"id": "EUVD-2026-102355", "enisaUuid": "ec2ac6d5-cd7b-38ab-b05b-9655529f172f", "description": "CFITSIO through 4.7.0 contains a heap-based out-of-bounds read vulnerability in the imcompress.c unquantize helpers that allows attackers to read memory before the fits_rand_value table via a zero or negative ZDITHER0 seed. Attackers can supply a crafted FITS file with a SUBTRACTIVE_DITHER_1 compressed image, read through fits_open_file() and fits_read_pix(), to cause crashes or leak heap contents in decoded pixels.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T18:57:21", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-15T18:57:21", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:L/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind-pwn/cfitsio-zdither0-dither-seed-oob-read", "https://github.com/HEASARC/cfitsio/blob/d6d27653740864a0483e74cff23c53e34e1dceee/imcompress.c#L5353-L5362", "https://github.com/HEASARC/cfitsio/blob/d6d27653740864a0483e74cff23c53e34e1dceee/imcompress.c#L7495-L7516", "https://github.com/HEASARC/cfitsio", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/cfitsio-through-4.7.0-heap-out-of-bounds-read-via-negative-zdither0-seed"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111124", "GHSA-9mqr-56x7-4gm4"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "66913f5c-5e4d-3b5a-a216-35c65fcccbd9", "product": {"name": "CFITSIO", "vendor": {"name": "NASA"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22644.7.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "56a65ba6-4d9e-39c2-9307-aabc4dbde2c0", "vendor": {"name": "HEASARC"}}], "isExploited": false}